        "description": {
          "raw": "Gerda uses a wooden ladle to splash spring water within a 2-tile radius, healing affected allies for 120% (ATK-based) + 10% (SP-based) HP and dealing 140% (ATK-based) + 15% (SP-based) damage to affected enemies. Enemies affected are put to sleep for 1s and cannot move or act. Each time a target receive healing equal to 10% of their max HP or is healed 3 times by Gerda's hot spring, the sleep extends by 0.5s up to 3s.",
