        "meta": {
          "Skill Range": "Global"
        },
        "description": {
          "raw": "When a battle starts, Gerda leaps forward up to 3 tiles and stomps the ground to unleash a spring, dealing 200% (ATK-based) + 20% (SP-based) damage with an interruption effect to enemies within 1 tile. Then she creates a hot spring within a 2-tile radius. Allies within this area recover 25% (ATK-based) + 2% (SP-based) HP per second, while enemies recover 4% (ATK-based) HP per second (capped at 0.5% of their max HP). Gerda is unaffected while casting this skill.",
          "active": [
            "When a battle starts, Gerda leaps forward up to 3 tiles and stomps the ground to unleash a spring, dealing 200% (ATK-based) + 20% (SP-based) damage with an interruption effect to enemies within 1 tile.",
